{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Hey Calvin! Long time no chat! How was the end of your tour? I bet it was amazing!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-b66fdd71ac239c9547835fbd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.005175+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b66fdd71ac239c9547835fbd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b66fdd71ac239c9547835fbd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Hey Dave! The tour was amazing! I was so pumped from all the energy from the audience. This pic totally captures how I felt. Such an amazing time!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-37edc283fff924562ac10954", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.027227+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "37edc283fff924562ac10954", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "37edc283fff924562ac10954", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Wow, that looks amazing! How was it performing on that big stage?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-1795eb39a282e681ac690d42", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.042264+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1795eb39a282e681ac690d42", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1795eb39a282e681ac690d42", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Performing on such a big stage was a dream come true! The energy was incredible and I felt on top of the world. It was seriously surreal."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-51cfc8d21539492f532ed80d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.052533+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "51cfc8d21539492f532ed80d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "51cfc8d21539492f532ed80d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Wow, that must have been an incredible experience! Congrats on achieving such an awesome moment!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-bf2295ce6620b77e8c9ce9c1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.068597+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bf2295ce6620b77e8c9ce9c1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bf2295ce6620b77e8c9ce9c1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Cool! Last weekend I started shooting a video for my new album - can't wait for you to check it out! Look how great it was!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-4c424722516f099341001bb1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.077552+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4c424722516f099341001bb1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4c424722516f099341001bb1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Wow, Calvin! Can't wait to see it. Will it be shot on location?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-9efb422dc72e59af8b7154f1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.097863+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9efb422dc72e59af8b7154f1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9efb422dc72e59af8b7154f1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: We're doing the shoot in Miami and picked an awesome beach. It's going to have some epic visuals!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-60b9ce3b10698cf24fe34c4f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.112606+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "60b9ce3b10698cf24fe34c4f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "60b9ce3b10698cf24fe34c4f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Sounds great, Calvin! The beaches in Miami are awesome - can't wait to see them!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-8ef3d1d45fb0eb83c4c6462f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.129812+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8ef3d1d45fb0eb83c4c6462f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8ef3d1d45fb0eb83c4c6462f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Oh man, they are amazing! I love the Miami vibe, it's perfect for the vid. Can't wait to show you!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-27918cccfac9d9782fb6aaba", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.145322+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "27918cccfac9d9782fb6aaba", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "27918cccfac9d9782fb6aaba", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Looking forward to it! I'm excited to see the vibe and the location. Let me know if you need any help with props or anything else for the video. I'm here to support you!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-f31d0d89dc2ccb02efb0a887", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.156683+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f31d0d89dc2ccb02efb0a887", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f31d0d89dc2ccb02efb0a887", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Thanks, Dave! I'll let you know if I need any assistance with props or anything else. Your support is much appreciated."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-37a37db44c980488bec09925", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.175286+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "37a37db44c980488bec09925", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "37a37db44c980488bec09925", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Sure, let me know when, I'm here to lend a hand. It's great to fuel your ideas. Remember that photo you sent me once? Love how this guitar shows our different artistic styles."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-b4bfafad13c4364db458024e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.192375+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b4bfafad13c4364db458024e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b4bfafad13c4364db458024e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Yes Dave, I remember! I had this custom made by my Japanese artist friend. It's got an octopus on it, which represents my love for art and the sea. It's one of my favorites!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-34b970c7492cea9817f9d93c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.206454+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "34b970c7492cea9817f9d93c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "34b970c7492cea9817f9d93c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: That's a great guitar, Calvin! Love the design, it's so unique and special."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-8e8eb66cbd95cb7fd422a3e0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.220049+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8e8eb66cbd95cb7fd422a3e0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8e8eb66cbd95cb7fd422a3e0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Cheers, mate! Really appreciate it. This guitar means so much to me; it's a reminder of my passion for music and the amazing friendships I've made."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-0199c75178f1539bbfea26ef", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.238815+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0199c75178f1539bbfea26ef", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0199c75178f1539bbfea26ef", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Wow, Calvin, this instrument obviously means a lot to you - it's like a representation of your journey, your passion for music, and the friendships you've made. Amazing!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-aedb7bf8cbf78218d6769517", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.254601+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "aedb7bf8cbf78218d6769517", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "aedb7bf8cbf78218d6769517", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Yeah, Dave! It's like every mark and strum holds a story. Take a look."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-7b569ee54dbd24a41514b40b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.267598+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7b569ee54dbd24a41514b40b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7b569ee54dbd24a41514b40b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: That guitar has a gorgeous purple hue. Why did you make it so shiny?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-f647c89516917110d9aed3c7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.282622+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f647c89516917110d9aed3c7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f647c89516917110d9aed3c7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: I got it customized with a shiny finish because it gives it a unique look. Plus, it goes with my style."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-fc805b273bb148e6b8f9628f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.294766+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fc805b273bb148e6b8f9628f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fc805b273bb148e6b8f9628f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Good pick! The customized purple glow gives it a unique look that really stands out."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-f65f165830041334db70d0f1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.312377+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f65f165830041334db70d0f1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f65f165830041334db70d0f1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Thanks, dude! I dig how it's so unique. It's totally my style!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-94d4cffaea7b76560fb7054c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.326714+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "94d4cffaea7b76560fb7054c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "94d4cffaea7b76560fb7054c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Looks great on you! Your unique style really stands out in your music and playing."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-ff6b675c03d3c06bf5126a3d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.342223+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ff6b675c03d3c06bf5126a3d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ff6b675c03d3c06bf5126a3d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Thanks, Dave! Trying to stay true to myself and be unique in my music is something that I value, so it's really great to hear that you appreciate it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-1744fcf89efffd16d5e1b43f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.357529+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1744fcf89efffd16d5e1b43f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1744fcf89efffd16d5e1b43f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Definitely, staying true to yourself and your style is vital. It makes you unique and your music stand out. Keep it real, bud. You've got something great to give the world."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_16-6e935a670bf3f835a5de332e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:06:45.372735+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6e935a670bf3f835a5de332e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6e935a670bf3f835a5de332e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
